      en: ["Built in the 16th century (c. 1550).", "Destroyed by the 1797 earthquake (magnitude 8.3).", "Declared a national monument in 1973.", "Area: approximately 2,000 square meters.", "Contains a small museum.", "Adjacent chapel restored in the 20th century."],
